<title>HONG KONG: Moody's lowers Thai banks' debt, deposit ratings.</title>
<headline>Moody's lowers Thai banks' debt, deposit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Wednesday it had lowered the senior debt and deposit ratings of five Thai banks to A3 from A2.</p>
<p>The banks were Bangkok Bank, Export-Import Bank of Thailand, Industrial Finance Corporation of Thailand, Siam Commercial Bank, and Thai Farmers' Bank.</p>
